  "intro": {
    "copy": "The brief was simple: put an albatross in the logo. The challenge was making it feel right for an AI business rather than a wildlife organisation. Instead of illustrating the bird, we reduced it to its most distinctive feature: the beak. Combined with two simple strokes, it forms the letter A, bringing the name and symbol together in a single gesture. From that deceptively simple mark, we built a complete visual identity.",
    "title": "Albatross",
    "subtitle": "Turning a bird into a letter."
  },
