      "_template": "twoText",
      "leftText": "Imagery",
      "rightText": "Albatross helps people make decisions with real-time AI, so the imagery keeps people at the centre. Portraits, hands and everyday moments are layered with the brand's glass forms and blue-to-orange light, showing the technology working alongside human judgement rather than replacing it. The result feels warm and human, while staying unmistakably precise and digital."
